  "news": "<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🇨🇳 大中华视角</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.scmp.com/news/world/united-states-canada/article/3373621/cornell-faculty-vote-no-confidence-leadership-after-gang-rape-case\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">康奈尔大学教职工在轮奸案后对校领导投不信任票</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Cornell faculty vote no-confidence in leadership after gang rape case</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">康奈尔大学数百名教职工投票，对校长和董事会主席表示不信任，此前一名学生在校内遭多名橄榄球队员轮奸，校方在处理此案时被指缺乏透明度和支持受害者。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">南华早报(独立港媒)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.taipeitimes.com/News/front/archives/2026/11/07/2003867305\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">台股暴跌，台湾将启动国安基金护盘</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Taiwan to activate NSF amid stock rout</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">在近期全球股市波动及本地经济面临不确定性之际，台湾金融市场出现大幅下跌，行政院决定启动国安基金以稳定股市，提振投资者信心，避免市场恐慌。（中立）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">台北时报(台湾)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.economist.com/china/2026/10/29/china-loves-to-rank-its-cities-the-government-wants-it-to-stop\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">中国政府希望遏制城市排名热潮</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">China loves to rank its cities. The government wants it to stop</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">长期以来，中国各地热衷于发布各类城市排名以吸引投资和人才，但近期中央政府认为这种做法导致恶性竞争和数据造假，正试图引导地方政府停止过度炒作城市排名。（官方视角）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">经济学人</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cr5yn9770pgvo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">香港特首就高层建筑火灾致歉</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Hong Kong&#x27;s leader apologises for deadly high-rise fire</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">香港一栋高层住宅楼近日发生严重火灾，造成多人死伤，引起社会广泛关注。香港特首在事发后公开向公众道歉，并承诺将彻查事故原因，加强消防安全管理。（中立）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">BBC中国报道</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://rfa.org/english/china/2026/10/28/china-taiwan-sun-yat-sen/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">中国利用台湾对孙中山的尊崇以推动“统一”</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">China leverages Taiwan’s reverence for Sun Yat-sen to promote ‘reunification’</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">中国大陆正积极利用孙中山在台湾民众心中的特殊地位和历史情感，通过纪念活动和文化交流等方式，柔性地向台湾社会传递“两岸统一”的政治信息，争取民心认同。（批评性报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">自由亚洲电台</span></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🇺🇸 北美视角</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.npr.org/2026/11/06/g-s1-152138/israel-election-palestinian-arab-parties\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">以色列大选悬而未决，阿拉伯裔政党受关注</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Israel&#x27;s Arab-led parties in spotlight after inconclusive election</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">以色列近期举行的大选结果未能产生明确多数，导致组阁前景不明。在此背景下，由阿拉伯裔以色列人领导的政党联盟成为潜在的“造王者”，其在未来政府中的作用备受关注。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">NPR(公共广播,中偏左)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.theatlantic.com/newsletters/2026/11/harmeet-dhillons-doj-resigned/689339/?utm_source=feed\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"