rap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">美国参议员J·D·范斯正在幕后积极推动达成一项新的伊朗核协议，此举旨在重新评估并可能修改现有对伊政策，以期在中东地区实现新的战略平衡。（政治观察）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">Axios(简报风)</span></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🌍 欧洲视角</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://english.elpais.com/usa/2026-11-06/trump-names-architect-of-his-immigration-policy-stephen-miller-as-white-house-chief-of-staff.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">特朗普任命其移民政策设计师斯蒂芬·米勒为白宫幕僚长</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Trump names architect of his immigration policy, Stephen Miller, as White House chief of staff</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">前美国总统特朗普宣布，若再次当选，将任命其前高级顾问、强硬移民政策的主要设计师斯蒂芬·米勒担任白宫幕僚长，这一任命预示着未来政府将采取更为严格的移民立场。（政治新闻）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">西班牙El País</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/06/kenyan-doomsday-sect-leader-jailed-murders-paul-mackenzie\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">肯尼亚末日邪教头目因谋杀190名儿童被判200年监禁</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4