为地震多发国家的地理现实，并检验了其防灾体系的有效性。（中立）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">日本时报</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.abc.net.au/news/2026-11-07/nashos-reunite-at-singleton-army-barracks/107354054\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">被遗忘的越南战争老兵重返军营</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">&#x27;Forgotten&#x27; veterans conscripted for Vietnam return to army barracks</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">一批在越南战争中被征召入伍的“被遗忘”老兵，在数十年后重返军营。这反映了社会对历史遗留问题的关注，以及对这批特殊背景老兵身份认同和精神支持的呼唤。（批评性报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">澳洲ABC新闻</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/paraguayan-president-pena-impeached-over-banking-crisis/article71676251.ece\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">巴拉圭总统培尼亚因银行危机被弹劾</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Paraguayan President Pena impeached over banking crisis</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">巴拉圭总统圣地亚哥·培尼亚因未能有效应对国内日益恶化的银行危机，被国会投票弹劾下台。此次弹劾反映了民众对政府经济管理能力的不满，可能导致政局动荡。（中立报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">印度教徒报</span></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🇳🇿 新西兰视角</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.stuff.co.nz/sport/361056203/standoff-sunk-netball-nzs-privatisation-deal\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">新西兰无板篮球协会与安娜·莫布雷及阿里·威廉姆斯合作破裂内幕</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">The stand-off that sunk Netball NZ’s deal with Anna Mowbray and Ali Williams</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">新西兰无板篮球协会与知名人士安娜·莫布雷和阿里·威廉姆斯之间的一项重要合作协议告吹，深层原因在于双方在关键条款上存在严重分歧。此次破裂可能对新西兰无板篮球的资金和公众形象造成负面影响。（独立媒体）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">Stuff新闻</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://newsroom.co.nz/2026/11/06/why-the-cost-of-conflict-goes-well-beyond-oil/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">冲突的代价远不止石油那么简单</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Why the cost of conflict goes well beyond oil</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">地缘政治冲突带来的影响远不止油价波动，还包括供应链中断、粮食安全恶化、人道主义危机加剧以及全球经济增长放缓等深远问题。这篇分析探讨了冲突如何从多方面对全球经济和社会造成冲击，值得各方关注。（分析性报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">Newsroom(深度报道)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.rnz.co.nz/news/emergencies_local/2393195/one-dead-four-injured-in-wellington-crash\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">惠灵顿发生车祸，造成一人死亡四人受伤</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">One dead, four injured in Wellington crash</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">新西兰首都惠灵顿发生一起严重交通事故，导致一人不幸身亡，另有四人受伤，伤者已被送往医院接受治疗。警方已介入调查事故原因，并提醒市民注意交通安全。（中立报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">RNZ(新西兰国家广播)</span></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🌐 中东·非洲·全球南方</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.aljazeera.com/economy/2026/11/6/us-urges-china-to-honour-busan-trade-deal-commitments?traffic_source=rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">美国敦促中国遵守釜山贸易协议承诺</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">US urges China to honour Busan trade deal commitments</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">美国政府呼吁中国兑现在釜山贸易协议中所作出的各项承诺，强调信守协议对于维护国际贸易秩序和双边经济关系的重要性。此举可能加剧中美贸易摩擦，值得持续关注。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">半岛电视台(卡塔尔)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cm5yne5984l0o?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">肯尼亚末日邪教领袖因杀害191人被判无期徒刑</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Kenyan doomsday cult leader given life sentence for murdering 191 people</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">肯尼亚一末日邪教组织的领导人因涉嫌诱导信徒绝食致死，并造成多达191人死亡，被法院判处无期徒刑。此案揭示了邪教组织的极端危险性，警示社会各界加强对类似事件的防范和监管。（中立报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">BBC非洲</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cx30ee8018lvo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">美国中期选举结果引发以色列对其未来两国关系走向的担忧</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">US midterm results spark fears in Israel over future of two countries&#x27; ties</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">美国中期选举结果揭晓后，以色列方面担忧美国国内政治格局的变化可能对其与美国之间的传统盟友关系产生影响，尤其是在关键的地缘政治议题上两国合作的稳定性引发关注。（中东媒体视角）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">BBC中东</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cqn06j0y61k6o?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">教宗肺癌手术数周后启程对拉丁美洲进行漫长访问</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Pope begins lengthy trip to Latin America weeks after lung cancer surgery</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">教宗方济各在接受肺癌手术仅数周后，便不顾健康状况，按计划开始了他对拉丁美洲的长时间访问。此次行程显示了教宗对该地区天主教事务的高度重视，以及其坚韧的毅力。（梵蒂冈视角）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">BBC拉丁美洲</span></div></div>\n</div></div>"
